<title>USA: Anangel-American changes fiscal year.</title>
<headline>Anangel-American changes fiscal year.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anangel-American Shipholdings Ltd said on Wednesday its board approved a resolution to change the financial year end of the company from June 30 to December 31.</p>
<p>The company's next annual report and accounts will be prepared as of December 31, 1996 and will cover the six-month period ended then, a company statement said.</p>
</text>
